ional, academic, healthcare or public-health institutions. A certificate should complement—not replace—the required nursing qualification and clinical training."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Nursing"},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc Nursing"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant specialization:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Psychiatric/Mental Health Nursing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest academic routes for advanced psychiatric nursing."},{"type":"h","text":"Other options"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on eligibility and career objectives:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public Health"},{"text":"Community Health"},{"text":"Mental Health"},{"text":"Healthcare Administration"},{"text":"Nursing Education"},{"text":"Nursing Research"}]}]},{"heading":"Other Academic Pathways","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Psychiatric nurses interested in broader healthcare careers may consider:"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MPH"},{"text":"Epidemiology"},{"text":"Community Mental Health"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Healthcare Management"},{"text":"Hospital Administration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mental-health research"},{"text":"Nursing research"},{"text":"Clinical research"},{"text":"Behavioral-health research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Education"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nursing education"},{"text":"Clinical training"},{"text":"Simulation-based education"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Psychiatric Emergency Nursing"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acute agitation"},{"text":"Psychosis"},{"text":"Suicide risk"},{"text":"Crisis intervention"},{"text":"Emergency psychiatric assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Addiction & Rehabilitation Nursing"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","ite